@startuml api-bet-games
title GET /api/bet/games & GET /api/bet/games/{game_id} — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/games\nor GET /api/bet/games/{game_id};

|BetGameController|
if (path is **games** index?) then (yes)
  :Validate query:\n**status**, **updated_after**, **sort**, **group_code**;
  :Clamp **page** / **per_page**;
  :Build **GameListFilter**;
  |CatalogService|
  :**CatalogRepo::paginateGames**;
else (detail by id)
  |CatalogService|
  :**CatalogRepo::findGameForDetail**(game_id);
  if (not found?) then (yes)
    :throw **NotFoundHttpException**;
    stop
  endif
  :Build **groupRows** from **game->groups**;
endif

|CatalogService|
:Collect **raw_id** values;
|CmsGameClient|
:HTTP fetch CMS metadata by **raw_id**;
|CatalogService|
:**serializeGameRow**(merge DB + CMS);

|BetGameController|
:Call **MallDictionaryService** resolve(['game_status']);
:**logHandledApiRequest**;
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**;

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
